      <p data-animate="fade-up" data-animate-delay="0.05" class="mt-5 max-w-4xl text-base leading-relaxed text-mute">Donegal is a controlled airport, so flying a drone nearby is regulated. Register with the IAA, hold the right authorisation, and get ATC permission before you fly. Below is exactly where you can fly — and how to ask.</p>

      {/* UAS Geographical Zones — schematic; exact boundaries on the IAA drone map */}
      <div id="uas-zones" data-animate="fade-up" class="mt-12">
        <p class="font-mono text-[0.82rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sand">UAS Geographical Zones</p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-mute">The control zone reaches out to 18.5 km (10 NM) and is split into three height tiers — no flights in the core, then 15 m, then 90 m toward the edge (cut off to the north-west where it meets neighbouring airspace). To fly inside it, or higher than a tier allows, you always need ATC authorisation — call the tower before and after your flight and keep your phone to hand. Hover a zone for the detail.</p>
        <div class="mt-6 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,300px)_1fr] md:items-center">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 300 300" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[300px]" role="img" aria-label="Donegal UAS geographical zones — concentric schematic">
            <defs>
              <clipPath id="uas-cut"><rect id="uas-cut-rect" x="-700" y="-350" width="700" height="700" transform="translate(150 150) rotate(215) translate(104 0)" /></clipPath>
            </defs>
            {/* rings drawn as annuli so hover highlights only that band; green clipped NW at the airspace boundary */}
            <path class="uas-ring" data-zone="EIU35" style="--zc:#4a9d5b" clip-path="url(#uas-cut)" fill="#4a9d5b" fill-opacity="0.14" fill-rule="evenodd" stroke="#4a9d5b" stroke-width="1.5" d="M150 6 A144 144 0 1 1 150 294 A144 144 0 1 1 150 6 Z M150 58 A92 92 0 1 1 150 242 A92 92 0 1 1 150 58 Z" />
            <line id="uas-cut-edge" x1="122" y1="8.7" x2="7.6" y2="171.9" stroke="#4a9d5b" stroke-width="1.5" pointer-events="none" />
            <path class="uas-ring" data-zone="EIU70" style="--zc:#e0a81e" fill="#e0a81e" fill-opacity="0.18" fill-rule="evenodd" stroke="#e0a81e" stroke-width="1.5" d="M150 58 A92 92 0 1 1 150 242 A92 92 0 1 1 150 58 Z M150 112 A38 38 0 1 1 150 188 A38 38 0 1 1 150 112 Z" />
            <path class="uas-ring" data-zone="EIU69" style="--zc:#c0392b" fill="#c0392b" fill-opacity="0.2" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="1.5" d="M150 112 A38 38 0 1 1 150 188 A38 38 0 1 1 150 112 Z" />
            <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="3.5" fill="var(--color-ink)" pointer-events="none" />
